cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Adaptive Bio-Signal DSP Pipeline with Hardware-Ready Fixed-Point Design"
abstract: >
  A real-time EEG signal-processing pipeline (RLS/LMS adaptive filtering, Wavelet
  Transform and Common Spatial Patterns feature extraction, fixed-point Q15
  conversion) with a lightweight neural-network branch (EEGNet-Lite, quantisation-
  aware training), designed with FPGA/microcontroller feasibility in mind.
authors:
